  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<div class="os-raise-ib-pset" data-button-text="Check" data-content-id="cdd4d2fb-1cba-41c6-bebe-94c325bf0a06" data-fire-learning-opportunity-event="eventnameY" data-fire-success-event="eventnameX" data-retry-limit="2" data-schema-version="1.0">
  <!--Enter Questions Below this line-->
  <!--Q1a-->
  <exercise data-content-id="74a88f37-794f-47ca-8826-0b457de51fd7" data-problem-type="dropdown" data-retry-limit="1" data-solution="Yes" data-solution-options="[&quot;Yes&quot;, &quot;No&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para>In questions 1 - 5, determine whether each ordered pair is a solution to the system.</para>
      <para>1. \(3x + y &gt; 5\)</para>
      <para>    \(2x − y ≤ 10\) </para>
      <para>  a. (3,−3) </para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct!  (3, -3) is a solution to the system.</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.14.2. </para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  
  <!--Q1b-->
  <exercise data-content-id="2abfa603-4fb7-439d-8aa4-313eef64088d" data-problem-type="dropdown" data-retry-limit="1" data-solution="No" data-solution-options="[&quot;Yes&quot;, &quot;No&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para>  b. (7,1) </para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! (7, 1) is not a solution to the system.</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.14.2. </para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  
  <!--Q2a-->
  <exercise data-content-id="9cacddc8-a918-46c9-99e6-6dfba810ca9f" data-problem-type="dropdown" data-retry-limit="1" data-solution="No" data-solution-options="[&quot;Yes&quot;, &quot;No&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para>2. \( 4x − y &lt; 10\)</para>
      <para>    \(−2x + 2y &gt; −8\) </para>
      <para>  a. (5,−2) </para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! (5, -2) is not a solution to the system.</para>
    </solution>
    <div class="os-raise-ib-pset-encourage-response">
      <para>Try again. Revisit activity 2.14.2. </para>
    </div>
    </exercise>
  <!--Q2b-->
  <exercise data-content-id="458317ef-7fa0-4860-a797-a2e026c3e5c1" data-problem-type="dropdown" data-retry-limit="1" data-solution="Yes" data-solution-options="[&quot;Yes&quot;, &quot;No&quot;]">
    <problem>
      <para>  b. (−1,3) </para>
